          Tightly coupled to embedded scalar cores (Snitch, CV32E40P, Ibex) without complex AXI4 crossbars. Eliminates inter-lane routing; single-port latch VRF provides 1–2 FLOPS/cycle at minimal dynamic energy, ideal for IoT edge inference.
